ightDistribClass` instance along a surjective function. -/\ntheorem rightDistribClass [Mul R] [Add R] [RightDistribClass R] (add : ∀ x y, f (x + y) = f x + f y)\n    (mul : ∀ x y, f (x * y) = f x * f y) : RightDistribClass S where\n  right_distrib := hf.forall₃.2 fun x y z => by simp only [← add, ← mul, right_distrib]","start":274,"end":277},"axioms":["propext"]}